OL,3,GNEWSAReform MS Joe Martin banned from
OL,4,Aspeaking in the Senedd
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Reform MS has been banned from
OL,7,Fspeaking in the Senedd until he
OL,8,Fapologises for claiming white people
OL,9,Fwere being replaced in the UK.
OL,11,FPresiding Officer Huw Irranca-Davies
OL,12,Fsaid Joe Martin's comments were clearly
OL,13,F"discriminatory" and "offensive".
OL,15,FOn Tuesday Martin asked the Welsh
OL,16,Fgovernment for a statement on the
OL,17,F"demographic replacement of white
OL,18,FBritish people".
OL,20,FReform was asked for comment.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
